# <project>/.gitignore - the project's workspace repo (see skill pp-project-config). An allow-list: everything at the
# top level is ignored, then only what the team shares is let back in. The code repos cloned inside this folder,
# fix-* folders, exports, PDFs and scratch files stay out without being listed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/memory/
!/log/
!/docs/
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/pp-project.yaml
# Not shared: .claude/settings.json and .claude/skills/ (hooks, permissions and tools would reach every teammate's
# machine unreviewed at their next session start), and tools/ unless its scripts take every value as a parameter -
# add !/tools/ back only then.

# Never shared, not even inside the folders above: personal files, raw data, run logs, token caches, OS files.
*.local.*
CLAUDE.local.md
logs/
*.log
*.csv
*.json
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.har
*.msapp
*.bak
*.zip
*.dpapi
*.dat
*.cache
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
.env
*.env
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
~$*
